      "headers": [
        "Domain",
        "Repository foundation or candidate source family",
        "Proposed acquisition and feasibility gate"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Map context",
        "Existing EPA ECHO, AirNow, public-water geography, and NC district data",
        "Preserve facility selection rules, source dates, district version, and limits of centroid-based association. A facility record is not proof of household exposure."
      ],
