    {
      "id": "BE-342",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_BACKEND_AND_DATA_PLAN.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 512,
      "end_line": 512,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Backend and Data Plan",
        "Deployment configuration and operational readiness"
      ],
      "sha256": "b5ca540d96fec225db045cf178a08c06877401ccf8a133567d0f6008839d61ae",
      "headers": [
        "Configuration group",
        "Current source names or implementation",
        "Verification before release"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Environmental providers",
        "`AIRNOW_API_KEY`, `GOOGLE_POLLEN_API_KEY`, existing Open-Meteo/NWS/OpenUV adapter paths",
        "Verify keys/access, API shape, supported geography, polling limits, declared units/source times and fallback behavior for each adapter. Review any hardcoded provider configuration without exposing it in logs."
      ],
      "table_start": 507,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "BE-342",
      "rendered_payload_length": 328,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "b5ca540d96fec225db045cf178a08c06877401ccf8a133567d0f6008839d61ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "BE-343",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_BACKEND_AND_DATA_PLAN.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 513,
      "end_line": 513,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Backend and Data Plan",
        "Deployment configuration and operational readiness"
      ],
      "sha256": "4d18b5ba3d62e417e009a9030e7f10dd032c4504e88a36571c01a046a5c6d618",
      "headers": [
        "Configuration group",
        "Current source names or implementation",
        "Verification before release"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Redis and budget guards",
        "`UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL`, `UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN`, current limiter policies",
        "Connectivity and scopes, shared cache persistence/TTL, circuit breakers and fail-open versus fail-closed spending consequences. Anonymous identity creation is not itself an abuse limit."
      ],
      "table_start": 507,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "BE-343",
      "rendered_payload_length": 296,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "4d18b5ba3d62e417e009a9030e7f10dd032c4504e88a36571c01a046a5c6d618"
    },
    {
      "id": "BE-344",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_BACKEND_AND_DATA_PLAN.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 514,
      "end_line": 514,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Backend and Data Plan",
        "Deployment configuration and operational readiness"
      ],
      "sha256": "9331d21a55876bc32dab021123648b2ee8249c9cb03e95be74e5a29ae56a2eb5",
      "headers": [
        "Configuration group",
        "Current source names or implementation",
        "Verification before release"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Luna provider",
        "`ASSISTANT_MODEL_KEY` or `OPENAI_API_KEY`; `ASSISTANT_CHAT_URL`, `ASSISTANT_CHAT_MODEL`, `ASSISTANT_CHAT_FALLBACK_MODELS`, `ASSISTANT_EMBED_URL`, `ASSISTANT_EMBED_MODEL`, `ASSISTANT_EMBED_DIM`",
        "Approved provider processing policy and permitted domains, model/token costs, timeouts and citation tests; model/dimension/corpus/RPC compatibility and retained provenance. Do not switch providers as an undisclosed privacy fallback."
      ],
      "table_start": 507,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "BE-344",
      "rendered_payload_length": 447,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "9331d21a55876bc32dab021123648b2ee8249c9cb03e95be74e5a29ae56a2eb5"
    },
    {
      "id": "BE-345",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_BACKEND_AND_DATA_PLAN.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 515,
      "end_line": 515,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Backend and Data Plan",
        "Deployment configuration and operational readiness"
      ],
      "sha256": "f8bef74969112458e409e8a26291600ac7e8dd50bb5065bed76bc4af619ddf03",
      "headers": [
        "Configuration group",
        "Current source names or implementation",
        "Verification before release"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Luna privacy and spending",
        "`ASSISTANT_SEND_HOUSEHOLD_CONTEXT`, `ASSISTANT_GLOBAL_DAILY_LIMIT`",
        "Explicit effective configuration returned to clients; missing context flag currently enables context. Proposed user consent must be enforced server-side. Global cap retains fail-closed behavior when budget service fails."
      ],
      "table_start": 507,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "BE-345",
      "rendered_payload_length": 321,
