        "Required fields and invariants"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Identity and access",
        "`source_id`, issuer, official landing URL, endpoint allowlist, access mode, secret reference name only, source owner/contact, operational owner, enabled domains, supported geography. No credentials in records or client bundles."
      ],
