    {
      "id": "DS-146",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_SOURCE_ACQUISITION_GUIDE.md",
      "kind": "table_schema",
      "start_line": 276,
      "end_line": 277,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Source Acquisition Guide",
        "Shared normalization and matching requirements"
      ],
      "sha256": "cc0f09bdcbb875dd0ffaab2be2fd8710edcb1c6127a511a0b238b3403f4a6d40",
      "headers": [
        "Problem",
        "Required implementation and test"
      ],
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "structure",
      "rendered_payload_length": null,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DS-147",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_SOURCE_ACQUISITION_GUIDE.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 278,
      "end_line": 278,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Source Acquisition Guide",
        "Shared normalization and matching requirements"
      ],
      "sha256": "5b55fcc173b960b2cb1e56ad92fef6ad4674f44ca2eebf856112781e9a98681e",
      "headers": [
        "Problem",
        "Required implementation and test"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Chemical identity",
        "Maintain source label plus reviewed analyte identifier/aliases. PFAS is a family, not one interchangeable measured substance. Preserve mixtures and method scope."
      ],
      "table_start": 276,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "DS-147",
      "rendered_payload_length": 185,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "5b55fcc173b960b2cb1e56ad92fef6ad4674f44ca2eebf856112781e9a98681e"
    },
    {
      "id": "DS-148",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_SOURCE_ACQUISITION_GUIDE.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 279,
      "end_line": 279,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Source Acquisition Guide",
        "Shared normalization and matching requirements"
      ],
      "sha256": "b6a3e531f235e99e0bdd2115d0ea82f957bba86d1dfae29663ad415f44407017",
      "headers": [
        "Problem",
        "Required implementation and test"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Units and sample matrix",
        "Retain raw text/unit/qualifier. Normalization includes conversion version and matrix. Water mass-per-volume, soil mass-per-mass and food tissue results cannot share one automatic threshold. Wet/dry basis and nondetect limits remain explicit."
      ],
      "table_start": 276,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "DS-148",
      "rendered_payload_length": 271,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "b6a3e531f235e99e0bdd2115d0ea82f957bba86d1dfae29663ad415f44407017"
    },
    {
      "id": "DS-149",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_SOURCE_ACQUISITION_GUIDE.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 280,
      "end_line": 280,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Source Acquisition Guide",
        "Shared normalization and matching requirements"
      ],
      "sha256": "501147b5be07565dfe37d7ce8743bad1ac96b75cb56fe2b007f7d1a3be16338b",
      "headers": [
        "Problem",
        "Required implementation and test"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Time",
        "Distinguish sample/observation, issue, valid, publication, retrieval and review times. Preserve date-only records as dates and user schedules with IANA time zone. Never invent midnight UTC observation time."
      ],
      "table_start": 276,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "DS-149",
      "rendered_payload_length": 217,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "501147b5be07565dfe37d7ce8743bad1ac96b75cb56fe2b007f7d1a3be16338b"
    },
    {
      "id": "DS-150",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_SOURCE_ACQUISITION_GUIDE.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 281,
      "end_line": 281,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Source Acquisition Guide",
        "Shared normalization and matching requirements"
      ],
      "sha256": "4f34f4057e28143b0037cba34d5acea53cbb0ec1a195f7b7f0c513a6294e4c4b",
      "headers": [
        "Problem",
        "Required implementation and test"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Identity",
        "Namespace PWSIDs, station IDs, facility registry IDs, advisory IDs, programme IDs and source row keys. Preserve raw values and reviewed crosswalks. Fuzzy names can suggest candidates, not confirm identity."
      ],
      "table_start": 276,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "DS-150",
      "rendered_payload_length": 220,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "4f34f4057e28143b0037cba34d5acea53cbb0ec1a195f7b7f0c513a6294e4c4b"
    },
    {
      "id": "DS-151",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_SOURCE_ACQUISITION_GUIDE.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 282,
      "end_line": 282,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Source Acquisition Guide",
        "Shared normalization and matching requirements"
      ],
      "sha256": "94cf57b3e044796535b950782e8f4e63e6033d65d12dc6d2c5b0720ddcc1c405",
      "headers": [
        "Problem",
        "Required implementation and test"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Geography",
        "Store point/area/segment plus CRS, geometry release and matching method. Source point, centroid and buffer are not exposure boundaries. Keep approximate user context separate from public source geography."
      ],
      "table_start": 276,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "DS-151",
      "rendered_payload_length": 220,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "94cf57b3e044796535b950782e8f4e63e6033d65d12dc6d2c5b0720ddcc1c405"
    },
    {
      "id": "DS-152",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_SOURCE_ACQUISITION_GUIDE.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 283,
      "end_line": 283,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Source Acquisition Guide",
        "Shared normalization and matching requirements"
      ],
      "sha256": "be0e8779d9fe82c1b7d285c26ed80c21d8b3eee6efadefa0824e64dff9907013",
      "headers": [
        "Problem",
        "Required implementation and test"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Completeness",
        "Know which pages/files/parameters were fetched. Distinguish not tested, nondetect, no coverage, fetch failure, stale, withdrawn and valid zero. No record count becomes a testing denominator without its population definition."
      ],
      "table_start": 276,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "DS-152",
      "rendered_payload_length": 243,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "be0e8779d9fe82c1b7d285c26ed80c21d8b3eee6efadefa0824e64dff9907013"
    },
    {
      "id": "DS-153",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_SOURCE_ACQUISITION_GUIDE.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 284,
      "end_line": 284,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Source Acquisition Guide",
        "Shared normalization and matching requirements"
      ],
      "sha256": "0ece814da836a52bbe8fa0e60c21007f57443f427de449af9085a7ffb4d329a7",
      "headers": [
        "Problem",
        "Required implementation and test"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Corrections",
        "A new revision can correct metadata without indicating worsening conditions. Saved tasks retain evidence snapshots and flag material changes. Withdrawal invalidates current guidance but preserves provenance."
      ],
      "table_start": 276,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "DS-153",
      "rendered_payload_length": 225,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "0ece814da836a52bbe8fa0e60c21007f57443f427de449af9085a7ffb4d329a7"
    },
    {
      "id": "DS-154",
      "source": "docs/product/HALO_SOURCE_ACQUISITION_GUIDE.md",
      "kind": "table_row",
      "start_line": 285,
      "end_line": 285,
      "headings": [
        "HALO Source Acquisition Guide",
        "Shared normalization and matching requirements"
      ],
      "sha256": "2fc3bb0220b398d111abf99aa8237ccc4432bfbd8f990b54d925b789a97c6379",
      "headers": [
        "Problem",
        "Required implementation and test"
      ],
      "cells": [
        "Scope",
        "No household location inference from event attendance, no pregnancy/age inference from general categories, no food inference from water, no agency receipt from an opened link."
      ],
      "table_start": 276,
      "feature": null,
      "disposition": "retained",
      "canonical_id": "DS-154",
      "rendered_payload_length": 187,
      "rendered_payload_sha256": "2fc3bb0220b398d111abf99aa8237ccc4432bfbd8f990b54d925b789a97c6379"
    },
